 "summary": {
  "headline": "Indogulf Q1 FY27 consolidated revenue fell 11% YoY to Rs 168.5 crore on delayed monsoon, while gross margin rose to 28% from 22%.",
  "overview": "Consolidated revenue fell 11% YoY to Rs 168.5 crore as delayed and uneven monsoon pushed crop protection demand into later periods, with softer pricing compounding lower volumes. Revenue rose about 12% QoQ from Rs 150.8 crore in Q4 FY26. Gross profit rose 12% to Rs 46.6 crore on a sharp fall in COGS, lifting gross margin to 28% from 22%. EBITDA was Rs 9.6 crore (down about 4%) with margin up to 5.7% from 5.2%, and PAT fell to Rs 2.4 crore from Rs 3.9 crore. Management framed the weakness as largely timing-related and declined to give FY27 growth guidance.</overview>\n<parameter name=\"financial_highlights\">[{\"metric\":\"Consolidated revenue from operations\",\"value\":\"Rs 168.5 crore\",\"change\":\"-11% YoY vs Rs 189.4 crore; +12% QoQ vs Rs 150.8 crore in Q4 FY26\"},{\"metric\":\"COGS\",\"value\":\"Rs 122 crore\",\"change\":\"-17% YoY vs Rs 147 crore\"},{\"metric\":\"Gross profit\",\"value\":\"Rs 46.6 crore\",\"change\":\"+12% YoY vs Rs 41.7 crore\"},{\"metric\":\"Gross margin\",\"value\":\"28%\",\"change\":\"up from 22% in Q1 FY26\"},{\"metric\":\"EBITDA\",\"value\":\"Rs 9.6 crore\",\"change\":\"-4% YoY vs Rs 9.9 crore\"},{\"metric\":\"EBITDA margin\",\"value\":\"5.7%\",\"change\":\"up from 5.2% in Q1 FY26\"},{\"metric\":\"Profit after tax\",\"value\":\"Rs 2.4 crore\",\"change\":\"vs Rs 3.9 crore in Q1 FY26\"},{\"metric\":\"PAT margin\",\"value\":\"1.4%\",\"change\":\"vs 2.1% in Q1 FY26\"},{\"metric\":\"Capacity utilisation\",\"value\":\"70%\",\"change\":\"vs 52% in FY26\"}]",
  "segments": [
   {
    "name": "Crop protection",
    "commentary": "Contributed 87% of Q1 FY27 revenue; early-season herbicide demand was most affected by sowing delays."
   },
   {
    "name": "Biologicals and plant nutrients",
    "commentary": "Each contributed 3% of Q1 FY27 revenue; management said biological and nutrient sales to brands rose to 22% from 11% (comparison basis not fully clear in the call)."
   },
   {
    "name": "Channel mix (B2C / B2B / Exports)",
    "commentary": "B2C 47%, B2B 40%, exports 13% of revenue in Q1 FY27."
   }
  ],
